# (0.29) apps on the Desktop (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes tests/app29d.keys from this;
# tests/mkapps.py desk1: /APPS/ONE and /APPS/TWO with shortcuts on the desktop (their icons
# from APP.INF: a file, a built-in name), /ZZGAMES.HZA and /ZZGAMEB.HZA (category Games;
# Game A opens .ZZT files), /ZZDOC.ZZT). Shots (the script's 'shot' lines; the Installer's
# steps wait for its console lines "install: asks: ...", "install: installed ..."), compared
# by tests/apppic.py:
#   1  Programs: the built-in programs, a line, "One App", "Two"; the two shortcuts
#   2  Files: ZZGAMES.HZA opened (typed, Enter): the Installer asks (name, version,
#      description, size, /APPS/GAMEA)
#   3  Programs after both installs: "One App", "Two", "Games  >"
#   4  "Games" chosen: its pop-up menu beside the Programs menu (Game A highlighted, Game B)
#   5  Files in /APPS, ONE selected, the menu key, Remove app...: the Installer asks
#   6  Programs: "Two", "Games  >"
# The console (tests/app29d.txt): Game A from the pop-up, in its folder; Game A again with
# /ZZDOC.ZZT (Enter on it in Files: its type is Game A's).
